    "notes": "A cat sound variant: adult_sounds and baby_sounds name the sound event of each noise a grown cat and a kitten make. This one mixes the classic cat with the royal cat purr. The cat keeps it in its minecraft:cat/sound_variant component, which new cats get from the registered variants. Each value is a vanilla sound event id; a sound of your own needs the object form { \"sound_id\": \"<namespace>:<event>\" }.",
